Qoder check-in follows the official desktop campaign API. CN and Global use the
same paths on different hosts:

  GET  https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns
  POST https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns/{campaignId}/claim
  GET  https://openapi.qoder.sh/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns
  POST https://openapi.qoder.sh/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns/{campaignId}/claim

CN was observed from Qoder CN 0.3.4. Global was observed from the Qoder desktop
client on 2026-10-07. The worker reuses the pinned AuthManager and does not copy
Qoder's campaign UI.
